# Linkagram context

Android app that resolves shared URLs, shows the redirect chain, and extracts
coordinates from map links. Public demo of AI-assisted development. No backend.

- Canonical instructions: `AGENTS.md`. Behaviour is specified in `docs/specs/`;
  decisions in `docs/decisions/`. A spec wins over this rule.
- Before changing behaviour, read the matching spec. If none exists, write it.
- Do not add: backend, accounts, analytics, ads, database, persistent history,
  WebView, JavaScript execution, Maps SDK, route building, location
  permissions, DI framework, extra Gradle modules.
- Single module `:app`; boundaries are `core/`, `data/`, `domain/`, `ui/`.
- Add an abstraction only when something in the code needs it today.
